# Phase 3: NREL PVWatts API key.
# Get one (free, instant) at https://developer.nrel.gov/signup/
#
# Copy this file to .env (drop the .example suffix) and paste your key below.
# The real .env is gitignored.
#
# Any of these variable names will be picked up — pick whichever feels natural:
#   PVWATTS_API_KEY   (specific to this project)
#   NREL_API_KEY      (matches NREL's broader API documentation)
#   ROCKIES_API_KEY   (older NREL examples sometimes use this)
PVWATTS_API_KEY=
